stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Validating : download() called
    Validating --> Failed : Invalid name or destination exists
    Validating --> Downloading : .part temp file created
    Downloading --> Cancelling : User clicks Cancel
    Cancelling --> Failed : Socket closed -> CancellationException
    Downloading --> Failed : Network error / SHA-256 mismatch
    Downloading --> Publishing : Bytes & SHA-256 verified
    Publishing --> Failed : FileAlreadyExistsException
    Publishing --> Saved : Files.createLink succeeded
    Saved --> [*] : SUCCESS logged & .part deleted
    Failed --> [*] : FAILED logged & .part deleted
